          "Understand the unopposed result as a strategic vulnerability, not a strength: whether it reflects Spiegelman's genuine roots or weak opposition recruitment, any challenger should probe this finding to determine whether constituent satisfaction is broad or limited to the Republican base, and whether the district is genuinely held or simply uncontested.",
