          "Lead with working-class economic security: property tax fairness, rural broadband and infrastructure investment, and workforce development that creates good-paying opportunities without requiring out-migration. At $66,719 median income and 74.2% homeownership, this is a constituency that has assets but is watching their margin for error narrow.",
