          "Engage Hispanic and Black constituencies directly on economic mobility and service access: at 18.2% Hispanic and 8.85% Black, these communities are part of the coalition but can become invisible in a majority-homeowner focus. Address workforce development, housing access for renters and first-time buyers, and healthcare access as specific constituent priorities rather than absorbing them into broader narratives.",
