          "Avoid any positioning that implicitly or explicitly treats communities of color as constituencies to manage or special interests to accommodate; at 29% Black, 8.4% Latino, and 2.3% Asian, this district's majority is people of color, and positioning that frames white interests as the default majority will actively alienate the decisive constituencies."
