          "Build active constituent service infrastructure now: an unopposed victory produces zero voter contact, leaving significant room for a challenger to define the representative's record when opposition emerges; proactive community presence, visible legislative wins, and accessible constituent service build a durable political position that survives a competitive cycle.",
          "Deliver specific attention to Black and Latino communities: the 22.93% Black and 7.83% Hispanic populations are significant constituencies with distinct concerns around housing equity, educational access, and criminal justice impacts; a representative who addresses these communities with specificity and delivers material wins builds a diverse coalition that is harder for an opponent to move.",
